    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Duel is local-multiplayer 1v1 2D-Arena-Shooter with deck-building elements. </strong> <br><strong>After each round the contestants add a card to their deck of upgrades. As the match goes on the madness escalates as the decks get thicker. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's local-multiplayer, so grab a friend - first to 5 rounds wins the match!</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Everyone can play - simple controls make it easy to get into. Battle with friends and family on a single keyboard or pick up gamepads and let it escalate!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECKBUILDING <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/3e31f11316e96d571a59027c275a6f63.poster.avif?t=1749413145\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/3e31f11316e96d571a59027c275a6f63.webm?t=1749413145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can improve your deck with over <strong>50+ cards</strong>. <br>The cards vary from bouncing bullets to wild effects like lightning striking the map. In classic rogue-like fashion you can re-roll your options too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NERF CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only upgrade cards can be drawn. Instead you can also select cards to weaken or annoy your opponent, for example with the &quot;Pogo&quot; card that forces the opponent to keep jumping or worsens their aim. BE MEAN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/17468561d4fff5f5cd1b0a195e0a0131.poster.avif?t=1749413145\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/17468561d4fff5f5cd1b0a195e0a0131.webm?t=1749413145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>20+ maps</strong> playable. Each comes with a unique gimmic, like a pit of lava, a giant escalator or teleporters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/783e0bdd1e7b16eb20ae0a476b108ab0.poster.avif?t=1749413145\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/783e0bdd1e7b16eb20ae0a476b108ab0.webm?t=1749413145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes <strong>20+ skins</strong> and allows changing your color and player name.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>CUSTOM MATCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Want more rounds, more rerolls or only want to play one map? Custom match settings allow playing the way you like.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Duel is local-multiplayer 1v1 2D-Arena-Shooter with deck-building elements. </strong> <br><strong>After each round the contestants add a card to their deck of upgrades. As the match goes on the madness escalates as the decks get thicker. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's local-multiplayer, so grab a friend - first to 5 rounds wins the match!</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Everyone can play - simple controls make it easy to get into. Battle with friends and family on a single keyboard or pick up gamepads and let it escalate!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECKBUILDING <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/3e31f11316e96d571a59027c275a6f63.poster.avif?t=1749413145\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/3e31f11316e96d571a59027c275a6f63.webm?t=1749413145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can improve your deck with over <strong>50+ cards</strong>. <br>The cards vary from bouncing bullets to wild effects like lightning striking the map. In classic rogue-like fashion you can re-roll your options too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NERF CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only upgrade cards can be drawn. Instead you can also select cards to weaken or annoy your opponent, for example with the &quot;Pogo&quot; card that forces the opponent to keep jumping or worsens their aim. BE MEAN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/17468561d4fff5f5cd1b0a195e0a0131.poster.avif?t=1749413145\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/17468561d4fff5f5cd1b0a195e0a0131.webm?t=1749413145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>20+ maps</strong> playable. Each comes with a unique gimmic, like a pit of lava, a giant escalator or teleporters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/783e0bdd1e7b16eb20ae0a476b108ab0.poster.avif?t=1749413145\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710490/extras/783e0bdd1e7b16eb20ae0a476b108ab0.webm?t=1749413145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes <strong>20+ skins</strong> and allows changing your color and player name.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>CUSTOM MATCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Want more rounds, more rerolls or only want to play one map? Custom match settings allow playing the way you like.</p>",
